g-[0.06em] uppercase font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] bg-[#99F7AB] text-[#111f26] transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-[0.88] hover:-translate-y-[1px] cursor-pointer border-none\">Hire Me</button><button class=\"md:hidden flex flex-col gap-[5px] cursor-pointer p-[6px] bg-transparent border-none\" aria-label=\"Toggle menu\"><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"transform:none\"></span><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"opacity:1\"></span><span class=\"block w-[22px] h-[1.5px] rounded-[1px] bg-[#D6F9DD] transition-all duration-300\" style=\"transform:none\"></span></button></div></nav><div style=\"padding-top:var(--nav-h)\"><div class=\"py-[60px]\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--glass-border)\"><div class=\"max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5 md:px-[60px]\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-10 px-4 py-2 rounded-[4px] text-[0.7rem] tracking-[0.06em] uppercase transition-all duration-200\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62);background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border)\" href=\"/\">← Back to Projects</a><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[18px] mb-[10px]\"><div class=\"text-[2.8rem]\">/assets/skillsphere.jpeg</div><div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-[6px] text-[0.68rem] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);color:#99F7AB\"><span style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.32)\">—</span> <!-- -->Online Learning Platform</div><h1 class=\"font-bold leading-none tracking-[-0.02em]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.8rem);color:#D6F9DD\">SkillSphere</h1></div></div><p class=\"text-[1.05rem] leading-[1.8] max-w-[640px] mb-7\" style=\"color:rgba(214,249,221,0.62)\">SkillSphere is a polished online learning platform where users discover and explore skill-based courses across multiple categories. It features smooth animations, full authentication, search and filtering, and a personalised profile system — all built with Next.js and MongoDB.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><a href=\"https://skillsphere-rosy.vercel.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-[22px] py-3 rounded-[5px] font-medium text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.05em] uppercase transition-all duration-200 hover:opacity-[0.88] hover:-translate-y-[2px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:#99F7AB;color:#111f26\">🌐 Live Demo ↗</a><a href=\"https://github.com/TanvirHassan-official/SkillSphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-[22px] py-3 rounded-[5px] text-[0.75rem] tracking-[0.05em] uppercase transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-[2px]\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-mono);background:var(--glass);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);color:#D6F9DD\"><svg stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" viewBox=\"0 0 496 512\" height=\"14\" width=\"14\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M165.9 397.4c0 2-2.3 3.6-5.2 3.6-3.3.3-5.6-1.3-5.6-3.6 0-2 2.3-3.6 5.2-3.6 3-.3 5.6 1.3 5.6 3.6zm-31.1-4.5c-.7 2 1.3 4.3 4.3 4.9 2.6 1 5.6 0 6.2-2s-1.3-4.3-4.3-5.2c-2.6-.7-5.5.3-6.2 2.3zm44.2-1.7c-2.9.7-4.9 2.6-4.6 4.9.3 2 2.9 3.3 5.9 2.6 2.9-.7 4.9-2.6 4.6-4.6-.3-1.9-3-3.2-5.9-2.9zM244.8 8C106.1 8 0 113.3 0 252c0 110.9 69.8 205.8 169.5 239.2 12.8 2.3 17.3-5.6 17.3-12.1 0-6.2-.3-40.4-.3-61.4 0 0-70 15-84.7-29.8 0 0-11.4-29.1-27.8-36.6 0 0-22.9-15.7 1.6-15.4 0 0 24.9 2 38.6 25.8 21.9 38.6 58.6 27.5 72.9 20.9 2.3-16 8.8-27.1 16-33.7-55.9-6.2-112.3-14.3-112.3-110.5 0-27.5 7.6-41.3 23.6-58.9-2.6-6.5-11.1-33.3 2.6-67.9 20.9-6.5 69 27 69 27 20-5.6 41.5-8.5 62.8-8.5s42.8 2.9 62.8 8.5c0 0 48.1-33.6 69-27 13.7 34.7 5.2 61.4 2.6 67.9 16 17.7 25.8 31.5 25.8 58.9 0 96.5-58.9 104.2-114.8 110.5 9.2 7.9 17 22.9 17 46.4 0 33.7-.3 75.4-.3 83.6 0 6.5 4.6 14.4 17.3 1